# Developer docs

Public exports need TSDoc. `AutoTypeTable` in `apps/web/content/docs` renders those comments. The generator uses root `tsconfig.docs.json` (`packages/*/src/**/*.ts`) — see ADR 0004.

```mdx
<AutoTypeTable path="packages/core/src/provider.ts" name="DatabaseProvider" />
<AutoTypeTable path="packages/postgres/src/options.ts" name="PostgresQuery" />
```

Do not paste the same fields into a handwritten `<TypeTable>`. Curated MDX is for narrative and examples only.

When adding a new driver or hosted provider package, add the docs page in the same change ([ADR 0004](docs/decisions/0004-docs-for-providers.md), [provider-docs rule](mdc:.cursor/rules/provider-docs.mdc)).

Product/architecture prose stays in `docs/*.md`. Do not fork it into a second type catalog.
